---
/**
 * bm-blog-archive-28 — TRANSLATED Bricksmaven skeleton.
 * Produced by bricks_translate.py from the ACSS payload
 * beside this file (blog-archive-28.json). Bank source, NOT a gold
 * exemplar: the SOP adapts props/copy/rhythm before
